G^{ij}=\kappa\Bigl(\epsilon-\frac{1}{4}\kappa s^{2}\Bigr)u^{i}u^{j}-\kappa\Bigl(p-\frac{1}{4}\kappa s^{2}\Bigr)(g^{ij}-u^{i}u^{j})-\frac{1}{2}\kappa(\delta^{l}_{k}+u_{k}u^{l})D_{l}(s^{ki}u^{j}+s^{kj}u^{i}),
